  "releaseNotes": "- Add: new StaleTags property in the factory execution context, to differentiate between stale tags and currently specified tags\n\t\t\t- Fix: wrongly ignored the currently specified tags when stale tags were present (see above)\n\t\t\t- Fix: when working with the HybridCache adapter, in some cases the LocalExpiration was ignored\n\t\t\t- Fix: WithRegisteredSerializer was asking to use the registered distributed cache instead\n\t\t\t- Fix: InvalidOperationException with Activity (OTEL) when using AlwaysOffSampler\n\t\t\t- Fix: small fix in xml doc\n\t\t\t- Update: package dependencies",
